🧩validated\solution-entity-classification.skill\solution-entity-classification.skill.md: 32
  [MUST] - **Internal Immutable** entities:
  [MUST] - Have only the internal `int Id` identity.
  [MUST] - Do not have a `Version` property or implement `IVersioned`.
  [MUST] - Do not have a `Guid` property or implement `IHasGuid`.
  [MUST] - Do not apply `solution-entity-concurrency-change.skill` or `solution-external-created-entity.skill`.
  [MUST] - **External Immutable** entities:
  [MUST] - Have `public Guid Guid { get; internal set; }` set once in the factory method.
  [MUST] - Have a unique database index on `Guid`.
  [MUST] - Implement `solution-external-created-entity.skill` fully.
  [MUST] - Do not have a `Version` property or implement `IVersioned`.
  [MUST] - Do not apply `solution-entity-concurrency-change.skill`.
  [MUST] - **Internal Mutable** entities:
  [MUST] - Have `public uint Version { get; internal set; }` mapped to PostgreSQL `xmin`.
  [MUST] - Implement `IVersioned`.
  [MUST] - Update and patch commands implement `IHasVersions`.
  [MUST] - Implement `solution-entity-concurrency-change.skill` fully.
  [MUST] - Do not have a `Guid` property or implement `IHasGuid`.
  [MUST] - Do not apply `solution-external-created-entity.skill`.
  [MUST] - **External Mutable** entities:
  [MUST] - Have both `public Guid Guid { get; internal set; }` and `public uint Version { get; internal set; }`.
  [MUST] - Implement both `IVersioned` and `IHasGuid` where applicable.
  [MUST] - Apply both `solution-entity-concurrency-change.skill` and `solution-external-created-entity.skill` fully.
  [MUST] - Re-evaluate classification when the entity's ownership or mutability requirements change.
  [SHOULD] - Review classifications during domain model refactoring or story planning.
  [SHOULD] - Treat external `Guid` as a correlation handle and internal `Id` as the domain identity, even when both are present.
  [MUST NOT] - Apply `solution-entity-concurrency-change.skill` to immutable entities.
  [MUST NOT] - Apply `solution-external-created-entity.skill` to internal entities.
  [MUST NOT] - Apply a dependency solution partially or omit required parts for a classified type.
  [MUST NOT] - Use `Guid` as the primary domain identity or foreign key for internal entities.
  [MUST NOT] - Use `Version` / `IVersioned` for entities that never change after creation.
  [MUST NOT] - Leave an entity unclassified or classify it at aggregate/module level instead of entity level.
  [MUST NOT] - Change classification without updating the implemented infrastructure accordingly.
